=== (b) defaults -> {MaxShortfallPct:5}; explicit 0 -> {MaxShortfallPct:0} ===
COMMAND: same -v run as (a).
  --- PASS: TestSpendingApplySavesSearchPreferences/defaults
      form {MaxShortfallPct: models.DefaultSpendingMaxShortfallPct}, want
